Stage 3: TEI Transformation (future work)
The final transformation script will include the following steps:

Instead of letting the LLM generate full TEI (which risks syntax hallucinations), the conversion from classified JSON segments to valid TEI-XML is handled by a wrapper script that adds the &lt;div&gt; tag:

&lt;div type="example_label"&gt;
&lt;!-- converted chunk content --&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

The LLM receives the chunk text in a separate request and converts it into TEI markup. It transforms only the content inside the &lt;div&gt; wrapper, not the surrounding.
The chunks belonging to one novel are sorted by source position and a full TEI tree with an teiHeaderis compiled.
The generated document is checked for valid XML before it is saved.

A manually transformed TEI example was created to serve as a reference for future transformations.
